 modeled in small animals.","topics":[],"score":222075,"global_rank":190258},{"name":"jhonsen/exploreMTAdata","owner":"jhonsen","html_url":"https://github.com/jhonsen/exploreMTAdata","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Exploratory Data Analysis of MTA Turnstile Data - METIS Project 1","topics":[],"score":222075,"global_rank":190288},{"name":"JeremyPVargas/portfolio_analyzer_tool","owner":"JeremyPVargas","html_url":"https://github.com/JeremyPVargas/portfolio_analyzer_tool","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"This tool models risk analysis of assets in a single DataFrame. The analysis includes risk-return metrics such as daily returns, standard deviation, Sharpe ratio and beta. Assets are evaluated using rolling statistics to track risk-reward behavior over time","topics":[],"score":222075,"global_rank":190315},{"name":"hashem20/billups","owner":"hashem20","html_url":"https://github.com/hashem20/billups","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222075,"global_rank":190316},{"name":"sungmoo89/sanfransico_bike_sharing","owner":"sungmoo89","html_url":"https://github.com/sungmoo89/sanfransico_bike_sharing","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222075,"global_rank":190318},{"name":"silvanoross/Arbitrage_Analysis_2","owner":"silvanoross","html_url":"https://github.com/silvanoross/Arbitrage_Analysis_2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Asset risk analysis","topics":[],"score":222075,"global_rank":190319},{"name":"thomasgreenacre/DE_Wk1_Project-3--Part1--core-","owner":"thomasgreenacre","html_url":"https://github.com/thomasgreenacre/DE_Wk1_Project-3--Part1--core-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score